TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece kasabada {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
festivali var!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Şöyle rahatlayıp Ay'ı seyredeceğiz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece Ay'ı görmeye mi geldin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Normalden de büyük ve harika görünecekmiş!
Sabırsızlanıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Heute ist {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Autumn Moon{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Da wird der Mond von allen
zusammen gaaanz lange angeguckt!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wer nachher zuerst blinzelt, muss
mir {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} ausgeben!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Äh, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}he he he!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The moon sure is pretty tonight!{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
It looks like a big bowl of vanilla
ice cream{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.with sugar on top!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ay bu gece cidden güzel!{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Kocaman bir kâse vanilyalı
dondurmaya benziyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.üstünde şekerle!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Everyone's always looking at the
moon tonight.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}If it were me{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} everyone were staring
at, I'd have total stage fright,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Tú a qué crees que se parece la
luna?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿A una tarta de merengue?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿A un queso?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿A una masa de pizza?
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Buf, qué hambre me da mirar
la luna,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cosa ti ricorda la luna?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Una torta di mele?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Una forma
di formaggio?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Una pizza bianca?
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ops! Certo che contemplare la luna
fa venire appetito,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}An was erinnert dich der Mond?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
An Apfelkuchen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Einen Laib Käse?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Eine Vier-Käse-Pizza?
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Menno, Mondangucken macht echt
Hunger,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece herkes sürekli Ay'a
bakıyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Herkes bana{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} öyle
baksa heyecandan
elim ayağıma dolaşırdı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Der Mond guckt heute so,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
als ob er am liebsten mit uns
zu Abend essen würde!
